{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/74e73fb07ccb/ch11",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 11,
      "location": "隊伍隨索菲亞北行追蹤約拿的行蹤,途中在艾爾夫森林一帶(舊稱「迷霧森林」)遭獸人襲擊。貝克威巧遇精靈族兒時玩伴珊,合力擊退企圖搶奪精靈長老藏寶處的獸人。珊不顧貝克威勸阻,執意同行加入隊伍。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_011",
      "title": "第十一章 — 迷霧森林,精靈珊入隊"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "北行尋約拿,似是迷路"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "索菲亞,妳確定約拿是往這裡走的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 11,
              "speaker_name": "索菲亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-11",
          "text": "他說他會一路往北,經由冰海的冰原到黑森林去,走這段行程的話,我想這條路應該不會錯.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "不知怎的,我總覺得氣氛不大對..會不會是走錯路了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 11,
              "speaker_name": "索菲亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-11",
          "text": "嗯..這附近的景色看起來是頗為陌生。早知道不該抄近路的.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "森林遭遇獸人"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 5,
              "speaker_name": "洛娜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-5",
          "text": "小心!附近有人!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人甲"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "text": "吼嗚!..我看到前面有人類!怎麼辦?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人乙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "呼..知道這裡有寶物的應該只有我們啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人丙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "text": "吼..管他的,妨礙我們的都得死!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人丁"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "text": "對!先宰了他們再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "麻煩了,這種獸人低智商又不講理,我們準備應戰吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "巧遇精靈珊,合力護寶"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "不過,他們提到的寶物是什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "不知道。此地應該離艾爾夫森林不遠,可是這裡的景色我卻從未看過.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "咦?你不是貝克威嗎?你怎麼會跑到這裡來了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "妳是以前住在我家隔壁的珊嘛!好久不見啦,聽說妳後來跟著大法師穆勒學法術去了..對了,妳在這裡幹什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "這裡就是我們精靈族歷代長老的藏寶之處,以前叫做「迷霧森林」的地方.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "對,我想起來了。這裡一向有大霧籠罩,我們從小就被告誡不準接近..這又怎麼了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "最近天地異變,千年來保護此地的結界不知怎的失效了,這些獸人得知此地有寶物,就伺機前來搶奪。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "有這種事!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人甲"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "text": "吼..原來這些人都是妳帶來的!都給我一起殺了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "貝克威,和我一起保護這些寶物吧!至少不要讓它們落入獸人的手中.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "可是我們還要趕路.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "沒關係,趁此機會活動活動筋骨,也沒什麼不好啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "謝了,索爾!珊,妳要多小心點!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "不要緊,我躲在你後面就可以了,我知道你會保護我的!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "說不過妳..好,大家上吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "擊退獸人,珊執意入隊"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "有賴各位的幫助,終於把這些獸人驅離此地..我代表精靈族謝謝各位。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "小事一樁!對了,貝克威先生,你難得遇見一個童年舊友,不留下來和她..好好聚聚嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "約拿囑咐的事情非常緊急,雖然這愛爾夫森林是我的家鄉,我想我沒時間在此停留.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "非常緊急的事?快告訴我!一定很有趣吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "珊!這是很正經的事,可不是小孩時代的玩意.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "什麼!你以為我在開玩笑!好,我就和你一起去一趟,看看到底是什麼大事!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "別亂來!這趟旅程相當危險,妳還是乖乖待在這裡.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "既然旅程危險,我就不會擔心你嗎?至少我也是大法師穆勒的高徒耶!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "唉!說不過妳..反正妳在家鄉八成也一樣不安分,就跟著我去好啦!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "太棒了,謝謝你!我叫做珊,請大家以後多多指教!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "歡迎加入!那麼,現在請妳當嚮導帶我們走過這片森林吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "沒問題!大家跟我來吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/74e73fb07ccb/scenes/3"
    }
  ],
